UnitVoterPaymentsModule::getFee
├── when the caller is registered
│   ├── when the caller rate is below the default
│   │   └── it should return the caller rate
│   ├── when the caller rate is above the default
│   │   └── it should return the default rate
│   └── when the caller rate equals the default
│       └── it should return the default rate
└── when the caller is unregistered
    ├── when restricted is true
    │   └── it should revert with NotRegistered
    └── when restricted is false
        └── it should return the default rate
